									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.poster.avif?t=1791543761" width=1170 height=292 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.webm?t=1791543761" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.mp4?t=1791543761" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >You wake up in a collapsing underwater military base. You don’t know who you are, or why you’re here. The only thing you do know — <i>time is running out.</i></p><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >Steel creaks. Water breaks in. Shadows move in the dark corridors. Every corner hides danger, and every decision can be your last.</p><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.poster.avif?t=1791543761" width=1170 height=292 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.webm?t=1791543761" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.mp4?t=1791543761" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >In <strong>Escape: Immersion</strong>, survival is about reacting fast, adapting, and pushing forward. The environment is unpredictable, the threats are real, and your past will haunt you.</p><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.poster.avif?t=1791543761" width=1170 height=292 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.webm?t=1791543761" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033680/extras/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.mp4?t=1791543761" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Classic linear adventure game</li><li>Unique VHS-styled visuals create an unfriendly, oppressive atmosphere</li><li>Intense gameplay full of dynamic and unpredictable events</li><li>Every mistake can be fatal — danger lurks at every step</li><li>A variety of situations and countless ways they can unfold</li><li>The base is almost completely absorbed by the ocean. Discover the secret of your past and try to escape before it’s too late</li><li>Water is not your worst enemy. Darkness hides more than you can imagine</li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					AI was used exclusively to create the comics featured in the game's Comics section. All other elements of the game were developed without the use of AI.				</i>
			</p>
